title: Guest 2. Load quotes and display holdings
config:
  theme: default
  themeCSS: |
    text[y="-25"] {
      font-size: 28px !important;
      font-weight: 700 !important;
      text-anchor: middle !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Dexie as Local Persistence<br/>(Dexie / IndexedDB)

    box rgb(219, 234, 254) FastAPI
        participant API as API Layer<br/>(Routes / Validation)
        participant Engine as Engine Layer<br/>(Risk / Optimization)
    end

    participant YF as Yahoo Finance<br/>(via yfinance)

    Note over User,Browser: Trigger: A portfolio becomes active<br/>from startup or user selection
    User->>Browser: Open or select a portfolio
    Browser->>Dexie: Read the active portfolio
    Dexie-->>Browser: Return portfolio holdings

    loop Each portfolio ticker
        Browser->>Dexie: Read cached 5-day quote and metadata
        alt Cached quote is fresh
            Dexie-->>Browser: Return cached quote
        else Quote is missing or stale
            Dexie-->>Browser: Return cache miss or stale quote
            Browser->>API: GET /api/v1/historical-prices
            API->>Engine: Validate tickers and fetch prices
            Engine->>YF: Download prices and metadata
            YF-->>Engine: Market data
            Engine-->>API: Normalized price rows
            API-->>Browser: Historical-prices response
            Browser->>Dexie: Cache quote response
            Dexie-->>Browser: Cache write acknowledged
        end
        Browser-->>User: Show price, value, weight, and day movement
    end
